<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  English — the source language and the default resources, so an
  unsupported system language lands here rather than on a missing key.

  Polish lives in values-pl/. Keep the two in step: a key added there and not
  here does not exist as far as R is concerned and will not compile; a key
  added here and not there simply shows in English.

  No string is hardcoded in a composable, even a one-off — the moment one is,
  the rule stops being checkable.

  "zł" is a currency symbol, not a word: it is identical in every translation.
-->
